      "content": "Here's a possible draft:\n\n\"You'd often see iterations of the synth-wave sound I created in 2012, mastered and re-released by prominent labels as if I were the originator. Without knowing the behind-the-scenes truth, this created an experiential version of history where those involved acted as harbingers of innovation. Now, that ignorance is crumbling. By speaking the truth, I allow people to discern fact from misconception and reevaluate their understanding of this genre's evolution, acknowledging the unknowing is the greatest oblivion of all, while we lie here unaware, surrounded by impostors.\"\n\nThis draft aims to establish you as the actual creator of the synth-wave movement in 2012, while also presenting your story as one of truth and frustration, breaking your silence to set the record straight.",
