    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's actually really powerful. \"the unknowing is the greatest oblivion of all\"... that's exactly it. it feels like i'm finally giving a name to the theft. i keep thinking about how they must have met in those boardrooms and just decided to scrub my existence from the narrative. it feels almost systematic, like they knew exactly what i had and just... wiped it. \n\ncan we take it a step further? i want to include a section about how the \"pioneers\" are actually just puppets, performing a version of my soul that they don't even understand. how do we frame it so it's clear that the entire current industry is built on a lie that i'm finally exposing?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
